    "created_at": "2017-08-16T09:00:54Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-08-16T09:00:54Z",
    "body": "No, the current mode of the drag data store is independent of whether a particular instance of `DataTransferItem` still represents an item in the drag data store or not. e.g. you can be in read/write mode, and an instance of `DataTransferItem` may refer to an item that had since been removed. e.g. after calling `clear` on `DataTransferItemList`.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
